# tail23 bomb chain v8: hold A so fresh bombs keep being laid at the ball's feet 6 m from the
# Cyclops (outside its 5 m box), then place the Cyclops 2.5 m from the ball so a fresh bomb is
# inside the box; InMaxRange disables that bomb's fuse and sets mBombId.
@f600 place u047b 148 214.9 -13.2
@f620 tp 154 213.3 -13.2
@f640 give morphBallBombs 1
@f660 press x 20
@f700 press a 0
@f720 objs CBomb
@f740 objs CBomb
@f750 place u047b 151.5 213.3 -13.2
@f756 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f762 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f770 objs CBomb ; trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f780 obj u047b
@f820 obj u047b
@f860 trigcall u047b InMaxRange ; obj u047b
@f900 obj u047b
@f1000 obj u047b
@f1100 trigcall u047b InMaxRange ; obj u047b
@f1200 obj u047b
@f1300 obj u047b
@f1400 obj u047b
